:false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-05T14:47:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T17:10:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe shader previews implemented in #117726 are very useful but require manual parameter synchronisation using the \"Update parameters\" button, which can be rather cumbersome, especially when you need to quickly debug values.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the synchronization automatic.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3bf8dc12-8bea-4548-9d9a-568302e5899c\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIn the original #117726 it was discussed that the parameters could be synchronized using the `property_edited`  signal of the `ShaderMaterial` sub-inspector. I adopted a different approach by using the `changed` signal of the `ShaderMaterial` resource, **which is now emitted** on parameter change **only in editor**. The doc was updated accordingly.\r\n\r\nThis modification makes `set_shader_parameter` 11% slower than before on average.\r\n\r\nI used the following code to mesure the performance difference: [test.gd](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29675635/test.gd.txt)\r\n\r\nAverage per frame (over 20 frames) :\r\n| no changed emitted| changed emitted |\r\n|--|---|\r\n| 2224 µs | 2485 µs |\r\n\r\n=> There is a ~1.11 factor between the mesures.\r\n\r\nIf the performance impact is too significant, we can look into other ways.\r\n\r\n>[!NOTE]\r\n**No AI** was used in the making of this PR.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120970/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120970/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}